                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Lewis Majendie 1756-1833, younger brother of Henry William Majendie,
                            bishop of Bangor DNB 1754-1830, married 1783 at St Marylebone Elizabeth
                            Hoghton, granddaughter of Timothy Hollis' sister Elizabeth who married
                            William Ashurst (d 1735), their daughter Elizabeth married Sir Henry
                            Hoghton and died in childbed 1761, her daughter Elizabeth survived and
                            married Lewis Majendie. Codicil to Timothy Hollis's will dated 16.5.85
                            mentions his niece Elizabeth Majendie Hoghton.</p> <p>28.4.1789 Majendie at T Hollis and 5.5.1789.</p>
